<title>CHINA: GYMNASTICS-LI XIAOSHUANG OUT OF WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS.</title>
<headline>GYMNASTICS-LI XIAOSHUANG OUT OF WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Olympic all-round men's champion Li Xiaoshuang will miss next month's world championships in Lausanne because of an ankle injury, an official of the national team said on Monday.</p>
<p>Li , 24, underwent surgery on the ligaments of both ankles after injurying himself in training last January.</p>
